WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
So this is all of me.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:07.000
You may see me on stage, back in this clip.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.800
You may see me back in the day
playing hockey for Australia Country.

4
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.000
And you’ll also know that I’m the person
who would, without a doubt,

5
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.800
have left my hockey stick, shin pads
and mouthguard in the hotel room.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:29.600
You may see me travelling over to Paris and London
and all these amazing places.

7
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.500
But you’ll also see me
with the daffodil lanyard on.

8
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:41.500
I can’t even find my way from the airport
through to the hotel without support.

9
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:45.500
So there’s so many different aspects of me,

10
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:48.900
and if you focus on one part,
you miss the other.

